{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"cuimao-e-o077","title":"何夔言于太祖请核之乡闾、明爵禄之制并修保举不实之令","accounts":[{"id":"cuimao-a-1742400c1f7cab4d4825","label":"正文","text":"何夔言于太祖请核之乡闾、明爵禄之制并修保举不实之令","evidence":["cuimao-q-b47b400f7bed5ee445f2"]},{"id":"cuimao-a-51cd0e851bef1c1ef337","label":"正文","text":"太祖称善","evidence":["cuimao-q-d67a392c8f957686777f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0323","role":"进言者","evidence":["cuimao-q-b47b400f7bed5ee445f2"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"称善者","evidence":["cuimao-q-d67a392c8f957686777f"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["cuimao-q-b47b400f7bed5ee445f2","cuimao-q-d67a392c8f957686777f"]},"ordering_evidence":"cuimao-q-b47b400f7bed5ee445f2","source_order":[12,228,63],"order":2793}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0323","name":"何夔","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"cuimao-q-b47b400f7bed5ee445f2","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-f9ef22c8ffa2e60b9af1","layer":"original","quote":"夔言于太祖曰：“自军兴以来，制度草创，用人未详其本；是以各引其类，时忘道德。夔闻以贤制爵〖7〗，则民慎德；以庸制禄〖8〗，则民兴功。以为自今所用，必先核之乡闾，使长幼顺叙，无相逾越。显忠直之赏，明公实之报〖9〗，则贤、不肖之分，居然别矣〖10〗。又可修保举故不以实之令〖11〗，使有司别受其负〖12〗。在朝之臣，时受教与曹并选者〖13〗，各任其责。上以观朝臣之节，下以塞争竞之源；以督群下，以率万民。如是则天下幸甚","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":227,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":63,"end":270,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-d67a392c8f957686777f","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-f9ef22c8ffa2e60b9af1","layer":"original","quote":"太祖称善","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":227,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":272,"end":276,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point